description=Per-game ultra graphics engine for Android arm64: MSAA anti-aliasing force, GPU + CPU performance boost, refresh-rate lock, game UI density mode, AI render scaling and colour calibration. The control app ships this module inside the APK: install it once, tap reboot, done. Companion app adds the Quick Settings tile, the game picker and the in-game HUD.
